    <edge source="source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:algorithm:text_logistic" target="source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:capability:intent" id="source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:relation:implements">
      <data key="d6">IMPLEMENTS</data>
      <data key="d7">{"head_id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:algorithm:text_logistic","id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:relation:implements","schema_version":1,"source_id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840","source_span":{"end":628,"quote":"TF-IDF + Logistic Regression 属于线性文本分类模型，可以实现上述客服意图分类能力。使用词级一元和二元 TF-IDF、sublinear_tf=True、max_features=30000；LogisticRegression 的 C=4.0、max_iter=500、random_state=42。特征提取与分类器放在同一 Pipeline，适用于上述英文文本多分类任务。","schema_version":1,"start":426},"tail_id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:capability:intent","type":"IMPLEMENTS"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:task:banking77" target="source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:capability:intent" id="source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:relation:requires">
      <data key="d6">REQUIRES</data>
      <data key="d7">{"head_id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:task:banking77","id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:relation:requires","schema_version":1,"source_id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840","source_span":{"end":424,"quote":"客服意图分类能力接收英文文本和训练标签，输出意图类别及按固定类别顺序排列的概率。适用条件是有监督标签的文本多分类。使用固定数据版本与类别映射；仅在训练集拟合词表和 IDF。评价指标为 Macro-F1 与 Accuracy，同时报告逐类 Precision/Recall/F1 和混淆矩阵；阈值通过训练/验证基线校准并在最终测试前冻结。","schema_version":1,"start":256},"tail_id":"source:3dde8ad7a184814bbf10b4c8afcc4c9bdc739d84d4bcb00a2cb6e4dd1a0ca840:capability:intent","type":"REQUIRES"}</data>
    </edge>
